
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>Welcome to Development Assessment Platform</title>
</head>

<body
  style="
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: #f4f7fb;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  "
>
  <div
    style="
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    "
  >
    <!-- Header -->
    <div
      style="
        padding: 30px 25px;
        text-align: center;
        background-color: #2563eb;
        color: #ffffff;
      "
    >
      <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 28px;">
        Welcome!
      </h1>

      <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 15px;">
        Development Assessment Platform
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div style="padding: 35px 30px;">
      <h2
        style="
          margin-top: 0;
          color: #1f2937;
          font-size: 22px;
        "
      >
        Hello <%= name %>! 👋
      </h2>

      <p
        style="
          color: #4b5563;
          font-size: 16px;
          line-height: 1.7;
        "
      >
        Welcome to the Development Assessment Platform.
        Your candidate account has been successfully created
        using your Google account.
      </p>

      <p
        style="
          color: #4b5563;
          font-size: 16px;
          line-height: 1.7;
        "
      >
        You can now complete your candidate profile, explore
        assessments, participate in coding challenges, and
        track your assessment results.
      </p>

      <!-- Features -->
      <div
        style="
          margin: 25px 0;
          padding: 20px;
          background-color: #f8fafc;
          border-radius: 8px;
        "
      >
        <h3
          style="
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #1f2937;
          "
        >
          What you can do
        </h3>

        <ul
          style="
            padding-left: 20px;
            color: #4b5563;
            line-height: 1.8;
          "
        >
          <li>Complete your candidate profile</li>
          <li>Explore available assessments</li>
          <li>Participate in development assessments</li>
          <li>Submit your solutions</li>
          <li>View your assessment results</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p
        style="
          color: #4b5563;
          font-size: 16px;
          line-height: 1.7;
        "
      >
        We are happy to have you with us. Good luck with your
        assessments and keep improving your skills! 🚀
      </p>

      <p
        style="
          margin-top: 30px;
          color: #1f2937;
          font-size: 15px;
        "
      >
        Best regards,<br />
        <strong>Development Assessment Platform Team</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div
      style="
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        color: #6b7280;
        font-size: 13px;
      "
    >
      <p style="margin: 0;">
        © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %>
        Development Assessment Platform
      </p>

      <p style="margin: 8px 0 0;">
        This is an automated email. Please do not reply.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

